#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example illustrates the CarSim Torsional Flexibility model on a Cross Slope Sine Sweep road.
#
#To see the vehicle settings, browse to the Vehicle: Assembly screen and click on the sprung mass blue link. This brings you to the Vehicle: Sprung Mass screen. On the Sprung Mass screen you can see the data for the Frame Torsional Flexibility.
#
#This example is overlaid with another simulation: "Chassis Flex: Rigid Chassis Overlay".
#
#A Frame Twist license is required to run the math model for this example. However, you can still view the simulation results provided with CarSim by clicking the "Video" and "Plot" buttons.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

